<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Arden, Apartment.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Arden, Apartment.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc said on Tuesday it started coverage of Arden Realty Group Inc as a buy and started Apartment Investment and Management Co with a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Arden shares rose 1/8 to 22-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Apartment Investment shares rose 1/4 to 23-1/4, a new 52-week high.</p>
</text>
